jobs.description:
An international organisation located in Brussels working in the investment field. 

Jobomschrijving

We are looking for a dynamic Assistant to work in the heart of Brussels! 

Your responsibilities are the following; 

• Welcome and direct visitors, manage logistics before, during and after visits (organising schedules, welcoming visitors, preparing and cleaning meeting rooms, organising catering, setting up equipment, etc.);	
• Manage incoming/outgoing standard and express mail and parcels (reception, encoding, distribution, dispatch);	
• Clean and organise office environment;	
• Prepare agendas and schedules for meetings;	
• Book taxis, restaurants and co-working spaces;	
• Help organise and prepare small internal events;	
• Logistical and practical organisation and coordination of domestic and international travels;	
• Administrative welcome for new employees;	
• Other related duties as assigned;	
• Back-up in case of absence of other assistants;	
• Team support when needed to accomplish results.

Which profile are we looking for? 

• High school diploma or equivalent experience (at least 1 year); 	
• Perfect knowledge of Dutch and English; knowledge of French is an asset 	
• Excellent knowledge of the Office suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint) and collaborative tools (Outlook, network, etc.);	
• Dynamic, flexible, ability to work independently as well as in a team;	
• Helpful, team player, solution oriented;	
• Ability to multitask, meet changing deadlines;	
• Excellent organisational skills and attention to details.
